# AutoSamplingTheory.TechnicalLemmas.Measure.L2RealSquareRootUnique

- File: `AutoSamplingTheory\TechnicalLemmas\Measure\L2RealSquareRootUnique.lean`
- Layer: Reusable Measure/L2 substrate
- Purpose: Bounded positive REAL A/B on arbitrary-measure L2 with equal squares are equal. Canonical complex lifts, complex positive-root uniqueness and real embedding injectivity prove the result; actual PBPS fixes the same scalar defect.
- Mathlib-quality status: Independent exact-science62 verified at 9d7f7b6. Scalar positive real root uniqueness only; joint GammaP/ontoM/typed B*B, centered inverse/polar/H1/dynamics/main/error/cost/composition remain open.

